    "scenesThatPass": [
      "FRANCES: ...Well, now, you lookin' forward to some good desert livin'?\nVIVIAN: Actually, I'm looking forward to getting out of these shoes. Frances answers as she looks away to wave at several PEOPLE she knows.\nFRANCES: Oh, it's awful when your dogs hurt.\nVIVIAN: That's the kindest thing anyone's said to me in three days. They both laugh as they approach the stationwagon. On the roof is a sandwich-boa…",
      "VIVIAN: +++Twelve years...\nFRANCES: We handle all gratuities.",
      "FRANCES: ..Think you might try a bit of gamblin' while you're here?\nVIVIAN: Not if I can help it.\nFRANCES: (waving to more PEOPLE out the window] ...Soon as we're out of this clatter, you can toll me all about yourself.",
      "VIVIAN: ...I've always lived in a city. ...I may feel lost in all this Space.\nFRANCES: I think of it as God's backyard ..-cleans up all the impurities.\nCAY: {yelling to Frances) ...I only went to sleep two hours ago! They need me for the day shift!\nFRANCES: You be home for dinner?",
      "LUCILLE: This conversation's for the birds!\nFRANCES: How ‘bout blueberry cobbler then?\nLUCILLE: I don't want to fall off my diet."
    ]
  },
